<html>
<head>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.2/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons/font/bootstrap-icons.css" rel="stylesheet">
</head>

<body class="bg-light " style="background: linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,0.6), rgba(0,0,0,0.6)), url('/images/background.jpg') no-repeat center center / cover;
            color: white;">
   

    <div class="container mt-5 pt-5">
        <div class="row align-items-center min-vh-90 mt-5"  >
            <div class="col-lg-7">
                <h1 style="font-size: 3rem;
                    font-weight: 800;
                    line-height: 1.2;">
                    Connecting Blood Donors<br />
                    With Those in Need
                </h1>
                <p class="">
                    Whether you want to donate blood or urgently need it, we help you connect with the <br />right people at the right time.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
        
    </div> 
    <div class="container ">
        <div class="mt-3">
            
                <a class="btn btn-danger btn-lg  me-3"
                   asp-area="Identity"
                   asp-page="/Account/Login">
                    Donate Blood
                </a>
                <a class="btn btn-outline-light btn-lg"
                   asp-area="Identity"
                   asp-page="/Account/Patient/Login">
                    Request Blood
                </a>
        </div>
    </div>
    <section>
    <div class="container text-center " style="position:absolute;  top:730px;">

        <h6 class="text-danger mt-0 fs-3">How It Works</h6>
        <h2 class="fw-bold mb-3">Giving &amp; Receiving Blood Made Easy</h2>

        <p class="mb-5 mx-auto" style="max-width:700px; color:#ccc;">
            MediBlood Connect makes it simple for donors to save lives
            and for patients to find matching blood quickly.
        </p>

        <div class="row g-4 ">
            <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="p-4 border rounded-3 text-start position-relative bg-dark">
                    <div class=" bg-danger text-white fw-bold fs-3 d-flex
                         align-items-center justify-content-center w-25">
                        01
                    </div>
                    <h5 class="fw-bold mt-4">Register &amp; Health Check</h5>
                    <p>
                        Donors create account to donate.
                        Patients register to request blood .
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="p-4 border rounded-3 text-start position-relative bg-dark">
                    <div class="w-25  bg-danger text-white fw-bold fs-3 d-flex
                         align-items-center justify-content-center">
                        02
                    </div>
                    <h5 class="fw-bold mt-4">Blood Donation</h5>
                    <p>
                        Donors donate blood. Patients connect with
                        matching donors instantly.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="p-4 border rounded-3 text-start position-relative bg-dark ">
                    <div class="step-number bg-danger text-white fw-bold fs-3 d-flex
                         align-items-center justify-content-center w-25">
                        03
                    </div>
                    <h5 class="fw-bold mt-4">Rest &amp; Save Lives</h5>
                    <p>
                        Blood saves lives while donors recover
                        knowing they helped others.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    </section>
    <section class="bg-light  text-center text-dark" style="position:absolute;  top:1230px; left:0;">
        <h2 class=" text-danger fw-bolder fs-2 mt-5" >About Us</h2>
        <p class="mt-3  mb-5  px-5">
            MediBlood Connect connects blood donors with patients in need through a fast
            and reliable digital platform. Our goal is to make blood donation simple, efficient, 
            and accessible, helping save lives when every second matters.</p>
            <br />
                        <br />
        <br />
        <br />
        <br />

    </section>
    

</body>
</html>

